 "description": "\n <p><b><font size=\"5\">Dog Puzzle Toy, Adjustable Treat Dispensing Ball Food Dispenser Tough Slow Feeder Puppy Enrichment Training Toy Pet Interactive Chase Toys for Small Medium Large Dogs<br></font></b><br>1.Rolling for Healthy &amp; Fun: dog treat dispenser toy will distribute food to catch your fur babies’ attention while they push and chase it. And by pushing and chasing and figuring out how to get more treats from the moving dog balls will help to improve our pets’ intelligence, bone healthy and digestion, providing them a fun time as well as physical and mental health.<br>2.Fit Most Kinds of Kibbles: The size of the holes to fall out food is adjustable based on your needs, you can fill in your fur friends favorite meals or snacks to make them interested, and the food will fall out smoothly without stuck while they playing it.<br>3.Safe and Durable: Our enrichment toys for dogs is made of food grade ABS, BPA free, safe and Sturdy. And the whole design is round and smooth without sharp edge to hurt your pets, you can rest assure the safety while your puppies playing it.<br>4.Easy to Use and Clean: Pretty easy to use: a, rotate open the small food box lid; b, add food into the box; c, close the lid and adjust the right hole size for the food; d, lit it roll. And every package will come with a product manual for instruction. It’s easy to clean as well, hand and dishwasher safe.</p>\n",
